<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">How To Get Tax Help</h2>
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <p>You can get help with unresolved tax issues, or der free publications and forms, and ask tax questions. The IRS provides a variety of resources to help you, you will have quick and easy access to tax help.</p>
      <p>Free help with your tax return. Free help in preparing your return is available nationwide at IRS Taxpayer Assistance Centers (TAC). Visit a TAC, or call 1-800-829-1040. For more information, visit www.irs.gov/help.</p>
      <p>Tax Counseling for the Elderly (TCE) program is designed to assist taxpayers aged 60 years or older. TCE offers free electronic filing and all volunteers are trained to help with tax questions. You can find a TCE provider near you at www.irs.gov/help/tce.</p>
      <p>IRS Volunteer Income Tax Assistance (VITA) and Taxpayer Assistance Centers (TAC) provide free tax help to individuals who qualify. These centers are located in many communities across the country. You can find a VITA or TAC near you at www.irs.gov/help/vita.</p>
      <p>For more information on these programs, go to IRS.gov and enter "tax help" in the search bar.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <p>Phone. Many services are available by phone.</p>
      <p>Ordering forms, instructions, and publications: Call 1-800-829-1040.</p>
      <p>IRS Taxpayer Assistance Centers (TAC): Call 1-800-829-1040.</p>
      <p>For more information about IRS services, visit www.irs.gov.</p>
      <p>Tax professionals: You can find a list of qualified tax professionals on the IRS website. These professionals can help you with tax questions.</p>
      <p>IRS website: www.irs.gov</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>Internet. You can access the IRS website, IRS.gov, 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.</p>
    <p>Mail. You can send your order for forms, instructions, and publications to the address below. You should receive a response within 10 days after your request is received.</p>
    <p>Internal Revenue Service</p>
    <p>1201 N. Mitsubishi Motorway</p>
    <p>Bloomington, IL 61705-6613</p>
  </div>
</div>

